      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Given series:&nbsp;56, 65, 83, 110, ?, 191</p>\n\n<p>56 + 9 &times; 1= 56 + 9&nbsp;= 65</p>\n\n<p>65 + 9 &times; 2 = 65 + 18 = 83</p>\n\n<p>83 + 9 &times; 3 = 83 + 27 =&nbsp; 110</p>\n\n<p><strong>110 + 9 &times; 4 = 110 + 36 = 146</strong></p>\n\n<p>146 + 9 &times; 5 = 146 + 45 = 191</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is &ldquo;<b>Option 2</b>&rdquo;.</p>\n",
